# Implementation Plan: Premium PDF Certificates

This plan outlines the steps to overhaul the certificate generation system with a professional, high-end design and a real-time PDF preview feature.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Backend (Laravel)

#### [NEW] [premium_certificate.blade.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/resources/views/premium_certificate.blade.php)
- Create a new "Premium" certificate template.
- Features: 
    - Ornate vector borders (simulated with CSS).
    - Watermark/Security pattern background.
    - Professional serif typography (e.g., Playfair Display or EB Garamond).
    - Gold-themed elements for "completion" seals.
    - Precision layout using PDF-compatible CSS (tables and exact positioning).

#### [MODIFY] [CertificateController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/app/Http/Controllers/CertificateController.php)
- Add a `preview` method that generates a PDF based on current branding settings (even before saving).
- Optimize `getImageData` to handle fallbacks for default logos and seals cleanly.

---

### [Component Name] Frontend (Next.js)

#### [MODIFY] [BrandingSettingsPage.tsx](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/admin/settings/branding/page.tsx)
- Replace the mock HTML certificate preview with a real **Live PDF Preview**.
- Use an `iframe` or `react-pdf-viewer` to display the actual PDF generated by the backend.
- Implementation: When branding settings change, the frontend requests a fresh PDF preview from the backend as a blob/base64.

---

## Open Questions
- Do you have a preferred "Premium" primary color (e.g., Gold, Navy, Deep Emerald), or should we stick to using your dynamic **Brand Color** as the main border/accent color?
- Should we add a **Professional Seal** graphic (e.g., a "verified" gold badge) to the design?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `Modules/Tenants/tests/Feature/BrandingTest.php` to ensure core functionality remains intact.
- Add specific checks for PDF content-type responses.

### Manual Verification
- Use the browser subagent to:
    - View the new "Premium" design in the admin dashboard.
    - Toggle colors and verify the PDF updates in real-time.
    - Download a sample certificate and inspect for quality.
